<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa money mkt shortage at 6.619 bln rand Thur.</title>
<headline>S.Africa money mkt shortage at 6.619 bln rand Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The South African Reserve Bank said  the money market shortage rose to 6.619 billion rand on Thursday from  5.912 billion rand on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
